	(text "GP6 high = the NPN conducts = the Melzi pin low = OK. A touch, a dead\nMCU (100k holds the base low) or a cut wire: the Melzi's pull-up\n(R401, sheet Melzi) wins = triggered."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 317.5 157.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "827ffc44-00f8-4601-9063-246ec195aad6")
	)
	(text "POWER"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 218.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5800a8a9-c31b-4348-8c41-641aae6f2e2d")
	)
	(text "The board: USB from the Pi (its 3V3 = +3V3_PH, the bridge's E+).\nThe tool: MP_Buck1 (+5V_BUCK1) through U953 and F951 to\n+5V_TOOL. Grounds: the one star point; R960 on the ON line."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 223.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6e765cec-708f-4293-8683-1bda7be7ebe8")
	)
	(text "THE BRIDGE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 110.49 218.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e96f6c91-6f31-4511-8c33-c7f65a9e042a")
	)
	(text "One full bridge, closed on the pads on HS: orange = E, blue = S.\nGreen: the tool's ID + the QRE's output, brown: the QRE's 3V3/GND.\nSign and grams on the bench; diag() noise with a tool going on and off."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 110.49 223.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "28cbc00c-816b-4349-8d94-42b8abf6ab74")
	)
	(text "THE ADC"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 198.12 218.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9f9cf94d-9b5c-41ea-8397-8e2fc606ab10")
	)
	(text "The plot bed board's sum chip: AIN0-AIN1, 330/s, DRDY2 = the touch IRQ.\nRatiometric: REFP0/REFN0 on the 3V3 that feeds E+.\nThe feet chip (CS1/DRDY1) is not fitted: firmware reports it missing."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 198.12 223.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "21de4e25-8e8f-472b-811e-cadbcc32e998")
	)
	(text "THE TOOL"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 288.29 218.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "31688763-fd9e-41f5-beec-224fa770cd1a")
	)
	(text "GP26: the ID (later the link), GP27: its pull-up, GP9:\nthe tool's 5 V, GP28: the QRE (tool seated, any tool with\na white label). Data pins inputs until the tool has 5 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 288.29 223.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8325ac39-571f-46d8-bff0-320296f87735")
	)
